KORTEX PAST EXAMINATION PAPERS
TOEFL - Listening (Year 2022)

Q1. What is the professor's main attitude toward early geothermal drilling experiments?
  (A) Skeptical of initial thermodynamic efficiency
  (B) Overly optimistic about mineral deposits
  (C) Indifferent to tectonic seismic risks
  (D) Hostile to governmental regulations
  Answer: A - The speaker explicitly questions early thermodynamic energy return rates.


